OL,3,GNEWSAA34 junction works completion     
OL,4,Adelayed until Spring                   
OL,6,FThe completion date for construction   
OL,7,Fwork on a new road junction has been   
OL,8,Fdelayed for a second time.             
OL,10,FSouth-facing slip roads are currently  
OL,11,Fbeing built for the A34 at Lodge Hill, 
OL,12,Fnear Abingdon, Oxfordshire - along with
OL,13,Fimproved provision for cyclists and    
OL,14,Fpedestrians.                           
OL,16,FThe project, which began in September  
OL,17,F2025, had first been due to finish in  
OL,18,Fthe summer, but that was pushed back to
OL,19,Fthe end of the year.                   
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
