OL,3,GNEWSAA34 junction works completion     
OL,4,Adelayed until Spring                   
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council now says the
OL,7,Fwork won't be completed until Spring   
OL,8,F2027, with the authority's highways    
OL,9,Fconstruction chief Liz Leffman calling 
OL,10,Fthe latest delay "a shame".            
